<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saturday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				buying rate	 selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   40.05		 40.10</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	62.50		 62.60</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 26.15		 26.20</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.358		 0.360</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   10.66		 10.68</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    10.89		 10.91</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.09		  1.11</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 8.30 pct	    8.50 pct</p>
</text>
